+# Shared rules, scope and remount
+
+Use the current shared rule model for regular and embedded fields. Historical
+FB-005 design text is a proposal, not the current persistence contract.
+
+- Persist `{ structure, ruleRegistry }`; entered values remain separate `formData`.
+  Actions are `hide`, `disable`, `enable`. The shared field catalog discovers embedded
+  fields alongside structural fields; do not introduce an embedded-only engine or
+  revive legacy `data-events` or `__formRuleRegistry` storage.
+- Resolve the owning main-form or step/subtemplate root, values and registry together.
+  Never combine a step root with main-form values. Rename rewrites source/target
+  references and migrates values within that scope while preserving rule IDs.
+- Delete removes rules referencing deleted IDs. Fragment duplication copies only
+  rules whose source and target are both in the fragment, remapping references and
+  assigning new rule IDs. Standalone import remaps references through the receiving
+  scope’s ID map and assigns new rule IDs. Revisions preserve valid IDs/references.
+- The renderer initializes defaults once, retains a runtime snapshot and hydrates
+  newly registered controls from that snapshot after rule-driven remount. Hidden
+  values remain retained but are excluded from active runtime context/save. Save
+  reads overlay raw Angular values, preserving explicit clears and disabled visible
+  controls. Read [field contracts](field-contracts.md) for default/clear semantics.
+- Test populated and explicitly cleared values across hide → show; assert actual
+  remounted control values and save payloads. Exercise embedded fields in both root
+  and step scopes and prove that another scope’s data/rules remain unchanged.
+  For identity changes, assert resulting references, values and rule IDs, not only
+  calls to a transformation helper.
+
+Current implementation anchors (paths relative to this reference):
+
+- [Rule model](../../../../../../src/app/main/components/forms/models/form-rule.model.ts)
+- [Field catalog](../../../../../../src/app/main/components/forms/utils/form-rule-catalog.util.ts)
+- [Scope resolver](../../../../../../src/app/main/components/forms/utils/form-builder-scope.util.ts)
+- [ID lifecycle](../../../../../../src/app/main/components/forms/utils/form-rule-lifecycle.util.ts)
+- [Runtime renderer](../../../../../../src/app/shared/components/form-renderer/form-renderer.component.ts)
+- [Embedded runtime regressions](../../../../../../src/app/main/components/forms/components/rich-text-runtime-field.component.spec.ts)
